OL,3,GNEWSACouncil leader voted out after no
OL,4,Aconfidence motion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council leader has been voted out
OL,7,Ffollowing a motion of no confidence.
OL,9,FGloucester City councillors ousted
OL,10,Fleader Jeremy Hilton earlier by 21
OL,11,Fvotes to 18 over claims of financial
OL,12,Fmismanagement and a lack of
OL,13,Ftransparency, after the bid to remove
OL,14,Fhim from the authority was submitted
OL,15,Flast week.
OL,17,FHilton has led a minority
OL,18,Fadministration since the Liberal
OL,19,FDemocrats became the largest party on
OL,20,Fthe council after the May 2024
OL,21,Felections.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
